## Original Content
<p>New AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools to better serve our global community of learners and customers Since our recent closing of the Coursera and Udemy combination, we’ve been focused on one priority: delivering more value for learners, partners, and customers. By bringing together our teams and expertise, we’re able to move faster and [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/accelerating-product-and-platform-innovations-across-coursera-and-udemy/">Accelerating Product and Platform Innovations Across Coursera and Udemy</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Following the merger of Coursera and Udemy, the combined entity is accelerating product innovations by introducing new AI-powered experiences, accessibility enhancements, and enterprise tools to enhance value for learners, partners, and customers globally.

## Key Points
- Coursera and Udemy have completed their merger and are focusing on integrated innovations.
- New AI-driven experiences are being launched to improve learning outcomes.
- Accessibility enhancements are included to serve a broader audience.
- Enterprise tools are being developed for business customers.
- The priority is delivering value through accelerated platform development.


